  "body": "## What changed\n\nScreenshot of the first page (1280x900, headless Edge, offscreen): https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/screenshots/pr-2046/first-page.png\n\n- The first page of the documentation site shows the CamCraft logo.\n  The logo sits centered above the title \"CamCraft\".\n- The logo is the 256 px square icon. Its corners are round (`border-radius: 24px`).\n- The rule is in `site/static/style.css` (`.hero .logo`). The image itself is not edited.\n- The image has `alt=\"CamCraft logo\"` and a fixed size of 128 by 128 px.\n- The title \"CamCraft\" is centered on the same page.\n\n## Where the site gets the file\n\n- The one source is `assets/logo/camcraft-logo.png`. `cargo xtask logo` makes the square icon from it.\n- The site uses a copy: `site/static/camcraft-logo.png` is a copy of `assets/logo/icons/camcraft-256.png`.\n- Zola cannot read files outside `site/`. A build-time copy would need a change to the release workflow. This PR does not change a workflow.\n- If the logo changes, refresh `site/static/camcraft-logo.png` by hand.\n\n## Pinning tests and checks\n\n- Verified by a second agent on head `c87fba57d` with Zola 0.23.6 (the version of `release.yml`).\n- zola build: clean\n- `python -I -X utf8 -m unittest discover -s site/tests`: 16 tests run, 16 pass, 0 fail.\n- No cargo command was run.\n\n## Screenshot\n\nFirst page, built with a local base URL, rendered in headless Edge at 1280 x 900:\nhttps://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/blob/screenshots/pr-2046/first-page.png?raw=true\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No other browser or window size was checked.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #2045\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
